From 14c73ec9312f72cd293eb692839a2c99d7c09774 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rajendertyagi <86180775+Rajendertyagi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 00:27:04 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 01/13] feat(mddbd): support Windows builds via
 cross-compilation

Replace unix-only syscall usage (Getrusage, Statfs) in mddbd with
platform-specific helpers backed by golang.org/x/sys/windows on Windows:
- processCPUTimes() -> GetProcessTimes
- diskUsage() -> GetDiskFreeSpaceEx

Add build-windows.yml workflow to cross-compile mddbd.exe and
mddb-cli.exe (CGO_ENABLED=0) and upload as artifact.
